  "title": "Origin Bancorp, Inc. Announces Declaration of | Origin Bank",
  "summary": "Origin Bancorp, Inc. (NYSE: OBK) (\"Origin\"), the holding company for Origin Bank, today announced that on July 22, 2026, its board of directors declared a quarterly cash dividend of $0.25 per share of its common stock. The cash dividend will be paid on August 31, 2026, to stockholders of record as of the close of business on August 14, 2026.",
